lations<input type="number" name="auto_submit_after_violations" min="1" value="<?=View::e($exam['auto_submit_after_violations']??3)?>"></label></div><div class="grid"><label><input type="checkbox" name="camera_required" value="1" <?=$exam['camera_required']?'checked':''?>> Require camera monitoring</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="allow_back_navigation" value="1" <?=$exam['allow_back_navigation']?'checked':''?>> Allow previous-question navigation</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="allow_question_jump" value="1" <?=$exam['allow_question_jump']?'checked':''?>> Allow numbered-question navigation</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="log_ip" value="1" <?=$exam['log_ip']??1?'checked':''?>> Log student IP and device details</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="is_enabled" value="1" <?=$exam['is_enabled']?'checked':''?>> Exam is available to students</label></div><p class="muted">Each new attempt randomly selects questions from the bank and shuffles their order. Students may receive different questions and question numbers. Changes to the number of items apply to new attempts; existing attempts keep their saved questions.</p><label>Audience<select name="audience"><option value="all" <?=$exam['audience']==='all'?'selected':''?>>All enrolled students</option><option value="selected" <?=$exam['audience']==='selected'?'selected':''?>>Selected students only</option></select></label><label>Selected students<select name="target_student_ids[]" multiple size="6"><?php foreach($students as $s):?><option value="<?=View::e($s['id'])?>" <?=in_array((int)$s['id'],$selected,true)?'selected':''?>><?=View::e($s['name'])?> (<?=View::e($s['id_number'])?>)</option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><button>Save exam settings</button></form>
